(text "04 Seven-pole LPF and selectable antenna network" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9d2775d6-a5e1-557e-a70f-53105ec7702f"))
(text "50-ohm reference port TP_RF precedes antenna tuning. No simultaneous dummy load and antenna.\nLPF: 1u/1200p/3.3u/1000p/3.3u/820p/1u. C0G RF capacitors.\nMINI: optional 2.2u/470p L-match, then 33u + optional 10u/4.7u/15u loading.\nFOX: bypass loading, select coupling capacitor separately; start 30cm vertical, field-calibrate.\nDefault R50/51/52/53/54 fitted bypasses for 50-ohm first-article tests. Loading coils DNP initially." (at 18 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bb106db1-6661-54ce-b7e0-2595c257bec7"))
